  "先检查 Tower of Hanoi 等任务与对应能力设置。": "Inspect tasks such as Tower of Hanoi and the corresponding capability settings.",
  "DoorKey 提供拿钥匙 → 开门 → 到达目标的可解释依赖。": "DoorKey provides interpretable dependencies: collect key → unlock door → reach goal.",
  "从套件选多步目标任务，观察持续交互中的执行表现。": "Select multistep objectives from the suite to study execution during sustained interaction.",
  "通过明确的资源与制作目标研究多阶段依赖。": "Study multistage dependencies through explicit resource and crafting objectives.",
  "泛化与分布迁移": "Generalization & distribution shift",
  "关卡、配置及任务分布变化下的泛化": "Generalization across levels, configurations and task distributions",
  "未见关卡、场景随机化及任务分布变化下的性能。": "Performance on unseen levels, randomized scenarios and shifted task distributions.",
  "Procgen 涉及未见关卡，SMACv2 提供随机战斗配置，MiniGrid 支持可控任务变化；泛化结论依赖明确的训练与测试划分。": "Procgen addresses unseen levels, SMACv2 offers randomized combat configurations, and MiniGrid supports controlled task variation; generalization claims require explicit train/test splits.",
