  "单位与起始位置随机化；额外定义未见分布后再检验迁移。": "Randomized units and starting positions; define unseen distributions before testing transfer.",
  "可配置任务族用于自建对照；需要自行明确切分协议。": "Configurable task families for controlled studies; define the splitting protocol explicitly.",
