  "资源约束与交互博弈中的策略决策": "Strategic decisions under resource constraints and interactive games",
  "资源配置、攻防选择与信息约束下的策略权衡。": "Resource allocation, offensive/defensive choices and trade-offs under information constraints.",
  "本主题覆盖 RLCard 的卡牌决策、Football 的空间攻防及 Orak 中的策略游戏；各类任务具有不同的决策层级与收益定义。": "This theme spans card decisions in RLCard, spatial offense/defense in Football and strategy games in Orak; decision levels and return definitions differ.",
