  "选择具体卡牌与对手，研究隐含信息下的决策。": "Select a card game and opponents to study decisions under hidden information.",
  "区分短场景与完整比赛，研究空间攻防的取舍。": "Distinguish short scenarios from full matches when studying offensive/defensive trade-offs.",
