  "历史信息利用、记忆依赖与受限观测下的决策。": "Use of past information, memory dependence and decisions under restricted observations.",
  "MiniGrid Memory 具有明确的历史信息依赖；SmartPlay 和 NLE 提供更复杂的历史利用场景，需通过观测控制与消融设计区分记忆贡献。": "MiniGrid Memory has explicit historical-information dependence. SmartPlay and NLE offer more complex settings that require observation controls and ablations to isolate memory contributions.",
