  "各游戏的能力覆盖存在交叉。官方仓库已归档；代码可访问不等于安装已验证。": "Capabilities overlap across games. The official repository is archived; availability of code is not an installation test.",
  "官方仓库标注于 2026-07-01 归档，链接于 2026-10-18 核查。": "The official repository reports archive status as of 2026-07-01. Linked and checked on 2026-10-18.",
