  "16 个程序生成环境；训练与测试关卡的选择是解释泛化结果的关键。": "Sixteen procedurally generated environments; train/test level selection is essential for interpreting generalization.",
  "表现受关卡分布、难度与训练预算影响，报告结果时需保留这些条件。": "Performance depends on level distribution, difficulty and training budget. Keep these conditions attached to reported results.",
