  "仅关联bsuite明确的Memory Length诊断环境，难度长度/大小是参数扫描。": "Route only bsuite’s explicit Memory Length diagnostic environment; lengths/sizes are parameter sweeps.",
  "仅关联bsuite明确的Deep Sea诊断环境，难度长度/大小是参数扫描。": "Route only bsuite’s explicit Deep Sea diagnostic environment; lengths/sizes are parameter sweeps.",
  "仅关联本轮核验的明确平台任务。": "Only the concrete platform task verified in this review is linked.",
  "分散控制多个单位击败敌队 奖励尺度与SMAC不同；不覆盖建造、经济或完整RTS对局": "Decentralized control of units to defeat an opposing team Rewards differ from SMAC; excludes construction, economy and full RTS matches",
  "EnvPool 论文图6实际PPO学习评测的Pong；仅该具体控制任务，不声明已核验整套环境。": "Pong in the actual PPO learning evaluation in EnvPool Figure 6; this task does not establish coverage of the entire environment suite.",
