  "原论文表 1 明确报告该 Atari 2600 游戏；仅接入本文统一 RL 协议。": "Table 1 explicitly evaluates this Atari 2600 game under the paper’s common RL protocol.",
  "论文图 3–4 明确使用双人 Leduc poker；挂接现有 Leduc 节点。": "Figures 3–4 explicitly use two-player Leduc poker; linked to the existing Leduc node.",
