  "从环境交互编写 Python 世界模型并用于规划，评价 Sokoban、MiniGrid 和 ALFWorld。": "Learn Python world models through interaction for planning in Sokoban, MiniGrid and ALFWorld.",
  "符号状态接口；不等同于像素端到端游玩，Sokoban 重点为基本能力而非最难关卡。": "Symbolic interface; not end-to-end pixel gameplay. Sokoban targets basic competence rather than hardest levels.",
  "符号化环境状态与目标。": "Symbolic state and goal.",
