  "CWMB 包含 18 个 RL 环境的描述与轨迹；另在简化 RTFM 评价代码模型与规划。": "CWMB supplies descriptions and trajectories for 18 RL environments; a simplified RTFM tests model generation and planning.",
  "CWMB 含非游戏连续控制；RTFM 固定手册并冻结怪物，不代表完整 RTFM。": "CWMB includes nongame continuous control. RTFM fixes its manual and freezes monsters, so it is not full RTFM.",
