  "STORM 在 Atari 100k 的 26 游戏上训练模型式 RL 策略并在真实模拟器评分。": "STORM trains model-based RL policies on 26 Atari 100k games and evaluates in the real emulator.",
  "RGB 图像和动作历史。": "Image observations using the paper-specific preprocessing.",
