  "MultiWorldBench 用 Minecraft 双玩家引擎重放参考评估视频/世界模型的独立控制和共享世界一致性。": "MultiWorldBench evaluates video/world-model independent control and shared-world consistency against two-player Minecraft engine replay references.",
